
Dataset

This project uses the NYC Yellow Taxi Trip Records dataset provided by the New York City Taxi and Limousine Commission (TLC).

Dataset Source:
NYC TLC Trip Record Data

Files Used
yellow_tripdata_2026-01.parquet
yellow_tripdata_2026-02.parquet
yellow_tripdata_2026-03.parquet
Dataset Description

The dataset contains detailed information about NYC taxi trips, including:

Pickup and dropoff timestamps
Passenger count
Trip distance
Fare amount
Total amount
Payment type
Pickup and dropoff locations
Note

Due to the large size of the dataset, raw data files are not included in this repository. The dataset can be downloaded directly from the official NYC TLC website using the link above.
